<title>USA: Duquesne Light consolidates generation.</title>
<headline>Duquesne Light consolidates generation.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>DQE Inc's Duquesne Light Co said Friday it has consolidated its power generation and named James Cross president of its newly formed Generation Group.</p>
<p>Since September 1994, Cross has served as senior vice president and chief nuclear officer. In his new capacity, the utility said, the Nuclear Group will continue to report to Cross, and the Power Supply Group, comprising the company's coal-fired power stations, also will report to him.</p>
<p>The consolidation of all power generation is another step in the restructuring of the company in preparation for competition in electricity markets, Duquesne Light said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
